[1846.891412, "o", "# flowr\r\n\r\nWorkflow orchestrator written in Go. Runs a DAG of shell steps declared in a YAML file.\r\n\r\n## Layout\r\n\r\n- `cmd/flowr/` — CLI entry point (`main.go`).\r\n- Build with `go build -o /usr/local/bin/flowr ./cmd/flowr`.\r\n- Runtime artifacts live under `.flowr/runs/<run_id>/` inside the working directory from which `flowr run` is invoked.\r\n\r\nThis repository starts with module metadata and project documentation; source files are expected under `cmd/flowr/`.\r\n"]
